{"id":275779971,"title":"247.fs模块-文件操作-event模块-参数传递","summary":"fs模块在node服务器中作用","content":"<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782802442899-4719561d-beae-4deb-b8bb-73eab0b61208.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782802677738-aaa5cc8d-10d3-4f06-9106-e7a0c5844742.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>fs模块在node服务器中作用</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782802942040-1e5e3312-3952-48a9-9d31-b3a09a702933.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782803071773-e4e44f50-5d2b-4064-b392-1ce831f2b94a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782803100145-01658d24-67b3-4b97-a4fe-c7729de78769.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node模块-fs文件读取的三种方式（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font></strong>）</p>\n<p>在node里，去使用单独的模块是需要去导入的。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782804060790-2bef9d8b-2e99-4f3b-8840-97d7bd23b7df.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782804523430-275aee81-ceb6-4fde-bc12-9d20eae48602.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782804652823-40175f7b-d77d-4bb9-9c3c-9010e73c1d9d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782805232942-534a4851-2a6c-45e9-9f23-6d1dc9234800.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782805686197-7296b2a3-e991-4d18-b743-1a2e067d2d6d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>所以我们要手动去关闭<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782805742496-9f71cf9c-f016-4be0-94f5-e6fe25495036.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782805809700-f36a0e08-3bf2-46f5-b480-a02f9ccd2d69.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node模块-fs模块对文件夹的常见的操作（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font></strong>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782806133878-074b3ff1-dc14-4fb2-8dbf-570be8a9fcb2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782806091037-06bc0510-6310-4932-9dc9-bc8d33b40dd9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782806362574-7999f087-07e9-4508-a7ae-4bb6752acacf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>w：会把原来的内容去覆盖了。a才是追加的。<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">flag默认的是w操作。</font></p>\n<p>写入的编码格式默认的是UTF-8<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782806706672-333a6186-20ae-4d68-9d0d-35c9428ed37c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782806729238-a72a28e3-3a73-4a4f-a9d4-7b9b7f9b5099.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782806827021-3e6e36dd-0c75-4107-82c3-36eb9be98451.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782807086596-fbdde86f-26fe-4468-9791-9b2dc97feab7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>读取文件夹里面文件的内容<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782807151102-573ffe75-2966-4674-a2e1-18231492037d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782808126302-c9de58b6-ce42-453f-a8ac-6e5079cdcc1c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782808167679-8860791f-bb41-439b-bebb-e45dad5d1fcc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782808318269-86a87d44-e960-44a4-acfe-93a1ded4d913.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782808403459-c52f2f29-1244-446e-9dd7-fced494736f9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782808503475-c2836557-d2a9-4380-bd15-09e922a06eb1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node模块-events模块的基本使用（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font></strong>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782808803030-c4fbccea-56f4-4096-8714-857f55d643f8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782809118998-84f7f5a3-ff92-4fbd-990e-0a9f55e81094.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node模块-events模块的取消和参数传递（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font></strong>）</p>\n<p>取消和没有取消的情况（取消后1秒钟后的那个事件监听就不行了。）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782809401010-512a5e1f-fa2b-4ddc-9093-9414b93b50d7.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782809423762-3600e55b-06a6-472a-b4ca-0aca60a2bad1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>参数传递</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782809612518-992b8013-e3dd-4dae-9a5e-e2121abccb49.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Node模块-events模块的方法和其他方法补充（<strong><font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font></strong>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782810122072-53402221-6cf4-48c8-b48a-cbe24f0673ce.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782810002493-79a54338-3866-4f77-b40c-0c6b8ec8c27f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782810037182-330d78a3-9062-4bcb-8c3b-093d6f77e8a8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782810074850-80b793fb-bb3a-492c-b93a-a4b61106a6c1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782810494803-520646d6-d1bd-459d-a713-720e302532e1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782810283040-e83d8094-d97d-4db3-a179-278bdb098bc6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782810388339-d674f72f-c693-463d-bebe-920e2b30beb3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782810476585-3ed3a73e-2deb-4f90-a400-39e5f5027075.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":80707835,"category":{"id":80707835,"name":"nodejs","description":""},"created_at":"2026-06-30T03:06:34.000Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T09:09:18.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hkk7kv/actk2mmepzfqgcia","slug":"actk2mmepzfqgcia","wordCount":220}